OL,3,GNEWSAInflatable monsters return to
OL,4,Arooftops after wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight inflatable monsters for a
OL,7,FHalloween trail are set to return to
OL,8,Frooftops across Leicester city centre
OL,9,Fafter they were taken down temporarily
OL,10,Fdue to windy weather.
OL,12,FBID Leicester confirmed the monsters
OL,13,Fwould be back in place from
OL,14,Fmid-afternoon on Tuesday until Sunday
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,17,FThe Met Office issued a yellow weather
OL,18,Fwarning for wind covering large
OL,19,Fsections of England, including
OL,20,FLeicester, on Friday, with gusts
OL,21,Freaching more than 40mph (64.4km/h) on
OL,22,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
